  "rawText": "# Style 1: Separate into muliple contexts.\n# ---------------------------------------------------------\nReviewSummary is PerformanceReviews: EmployeeId EmployeeId, \n    AVG(Rating) AverageRating, \n    SUM(BonusAmount) Bonuses\n  Where ReviewYear = \u003C2025\u003E\n  \nEmployees: Department.Name Department,\n    COUNT(Id) TotalEmployees,\n    AVG(Salary) AverageSalary,\n    SUM(Salary) AnnualPayroll,\n    AVG(ReviewSummary.AverageRating) AverageRating,\n    SUM(Coalesce(ReviewSummary.Bonuses, \u003C0\u003E)) TotalBonuses\n  Left Join ReviewSummary ReviewSummary On Id = ReviewSummary.EmployeeId\n  Order AnnualPayroll ASC\n\n# Style 2: Using fluent syntax with without JOIN.\n# ---------------------------------------------------------\nDepartments:\n    Name\n    Employees.Count(Id) TotalEmployees\n    Employees.Avg(Salary) AverageSalary\n    Employees.Sum(Salary) AnnualPayroll\n    Employees.Avg(PerformanceReviews.AvgIf(Rating, ReviewYear = 2025)) AverageRating\n    Employees.Sum(PerformanceReviews.SumIf(BonusAmount, ReviewYear = 2025)) TotalBonuses\n Order AnnualPayroll ASC",
